Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.69,0:22:53.26,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It's sudden, so I'll show you some faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.80,0:22:55.59,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Angry face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.59,0:22:57.65,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Bored face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.18,0:22:59.88,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Embarrased face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.02,0:23:02.95,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Good afternoon, Rin here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.95,0:23:05.19,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi is going out to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.84,0:23:08.72,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,But will he end up going out alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.22,0:23:11.31,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,It was so important to him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:13.29,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,that he would even let me stay home alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.35,0:23:17.25,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,The next story is "Daikichi Should Stay Daikichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.87,0:23:19.04,Main Dialog,,0000,0000,0000,,"More" face.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.92,0:02:20.18,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ashita no koto wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.60,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kore tte gisei to wa chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.30,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nanika ga chigau
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.30,0:02:28.92,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}batsu ge-mu ja nante omowanai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.92,0:02:32.17,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}de nande na no ka wa wakannai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.17,0:02:35.57,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}chotto shakuzen to shinai kedo
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.57,0:02:41.12,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi no sonzai ima daiji da nante mon ja nai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.62,0:02:47.38,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}owaranai koto nante kono yo no doko ni mo nai
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.49,0:02:51.93,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}naku no wa tsurain ja nai no
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.93,0:02:54.63,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}ai no Sweet Drops, Sweet Drops
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.63,0:02:58.07,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}zutto yume mite itai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.20,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}motto yasashiku shitai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.59,0:03:04.96,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kimi to iraretara Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:03:04.96,0:03:08.18,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}onna no ko tte tsuyoi ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.18,0:03:11.49,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}dakedo tokidoki yowai ne
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.85,0:03:18.18,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}bokura no negai wa Happy Happy Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.62,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}sonna hibi mo Happy
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.06,0:03:29.33,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.92,0:02:20.18,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}We don't know what'll happen tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:20.18,0:02:23.60,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This feels different from a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:23.60,0:02:25.30,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Something feels different.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:25.30,0:02:28.92,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm not thinking of it as a punishment game.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.92,0:02:32.17,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I still don't know why.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.17,0:02:35.57,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though I don't quite feel satisfied with that,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.57,0:02:41.12,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}there's no question that you're important to me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.62,0:02:47.38,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}There's nothing in this world that's endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:48.49,0:02:51.72,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Isn't it painful having to cry?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.93,0:02:54.52,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Love's sweet drops, sweet drops.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.63,0:02:58.07,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to keep dreaming forever?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:58.07,0:03:01.20,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you want to be kinder?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.59,0:03:04.96,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}As long as I'm with you, I'm happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:04.96,0:03:08.18,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Don't you think girls can be strong?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.18,0:03:11.49,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even though we can be weak sometimes.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:11.85,0:03:18.18,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our wish is for happy, happy, happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.18,0:03:21.62,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Those days can also be happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:25.06,0:03:29.33,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Just wanna make you happy.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:55.95,0:21:00.44,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}nichiyou no hareta hirusagari
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.11,0:21:03.97,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kyou wa doko e yukou?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:06.37,0:21:10.93,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}kayoi nareta itsumo no michi ga
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.93,0:21:15.53,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mabushiku kagayaite mieru
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.66,0:21:20.88,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}terasu atatakai taiyou to
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.90,0:21:25.96,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}tonari ni kimi ga ireba
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.96,0:21:30.04,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.63,0:21:35.91,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}hashagidasu kimochi ni
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.27,0:21:40.48,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}utae Life Life Life
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.12,0:21:46.79,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe wa dokomademo
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.95,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}mou High High High
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.61,0:21:56.57,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}maiagaru kaze ni nori
