Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.95,0:22:10.49,ED Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}koe mo tobihaneru
Dialogue: 4,0:20:55.95,0:21:00.44,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}It's a sunny Sunday, early in the afternoon.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:01.11,0:21:03.97,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Where should we go today?
Dialogue: 4,0:21:06.37,0:21:10.93,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}This path I've grown so used to taking
Dialogue: 4,0:21:10.93,0:21:15.53,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}seems to be shining brightly,
Dialogue: 4,0:21:16.66,0:21:20.88,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}as long as the warm sun is shining
Dialogue: 4,0:21:21.90,0:21:25.96,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}and you are here beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:25.96,0:21:30.04,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:30.63,0:21:35.91,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I feel like frolicking about.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:36.27,0:21:40.48,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:41.12,0:21:46.79,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Our voices can go anywhere.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:46.79,0:21:50.95,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm already high, high, high.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:51.61,0:21:56.57,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}I'm riding on the rising wind.
Dialogue: 4,0:21:57.26,0:22:01.43,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Let's sing, life, life, life.
Dialogue: 4,0:22:01.95,0:22:10.49,ED English,,0000,0000,0000,,{\be1}Even our voices will be bouncing.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:07.82,0:00:08.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mama?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:08.61,0:00:11.28,Main Dialog,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Well, your father always picks you up, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:12.70,0:00:15.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi isn't my father.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:15.07,0:00:17.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My father is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.28,0:00:19.66,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:19.66,0:00:22.41,Main Dialog,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has a mother and father.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.79,0:00:25.62,Main Dialog,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,So what's Daikichi?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.50,0:00:29.21,Main Dialog,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.21,0:00:31.51,Main Dialog,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan always says strange stuff!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.75,0:00:31.51,Alt,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Men can't have babies!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.51,0:00:32.30,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:32.30,0:00:35.05,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need a dad!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:35.05,0:00:36.18,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dummies!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.18,0:00:37.80,Main Dialog,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,It takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.18,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Dummy, dummy, dummy!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.48,Main Dialog,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:42.47,0:00:43.48,Alt,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.48,0:00:46.98,Main Dialog,Yuki,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun called me a dummy!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:45.23,0:00:47.69,Alt,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun kept saying dummy!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.65,Main Dialog,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 4,0:00:52.36,0:00:54.99,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, do you just live with your mother?
Dialogue: 4,0:00:55.49,0:00:58.95,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,My dad went off somewhere, and then they got a divorce.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.95,0:01:00.45,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's a "divorce"?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.83,0:01:06.00,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,It's quitting marriage!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.71,0:01:10.46,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe my mother is gone because she got a divorce...
Dialogue: 4,0:01:10.96,0:01:12.17,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I dunno.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.51,0:01:15.72,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't wear your hat, they'll get mad at you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.18,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:01:20.47,0:01:22.39,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your string is stretched out.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.23,0:01:32.65,Main Dialog,Nao,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! You're getting picked up!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.65,0:01:34.53,Main Dialog,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.32,0:01:34.53,Alt,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It's Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:34.53,0:01:36.11,Main Dialog,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,He's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.03,0:01:38.11,Alt,Maa-kun,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-tan, pibbup!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.62,0:01:43.33,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun, it's okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.13,0:01:55.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.09,0:01:56.80,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,See you tomorrow, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:56.80,0:01:58.34,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 4,0:01:58.34,0:01:59.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you feel like having for dinner?
Dialogue: 4,0:02:00.30,0:02:01.97,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Um, let's see...
Dialogue: 4,0:02:02.64,0:02:03.76,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:02:04.26,0:02:06.89,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:42.11,0:03:44.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mother's beautiful, you know?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:44.74,0:03:47.16,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,At home, she's a noisy old woman!
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.70,0:03:51.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:51.41,0:03:54.75,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Apparently, Rin always looks after Kouki...
Dialogue: 4,0:03:54.75,0:03:56.42,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:03:56.42,0:04:01.67,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,My son can be a little abrasive, so he's had trouble making friends...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.67,0:04:03.38,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, no! Not at all...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.55,0:04:06.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I should be thanking you...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:06.60,0:04:09.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My Rin is incredibly unsociable...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.14,0:04:11.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's like birds of a feather flock together, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.85,0:04:16.02,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You were just talking about me, weren't you?!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:16.02,0:04:17.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't saying anything bad.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.90,0:04:19.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Now walk fast.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want you to demand that I carry you half the way again...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.24,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't say that!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.11,0:04:23.86,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.91,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Is Rin-chan Daddy's girl?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.99,0:04:31.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm not her father.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.95,0:04:34.21,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm more like a relative, or...
Dialogue: 4,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.17,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'm sorry, what was I thinking?!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.17,0:04:37.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,N-Not at all!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:37.46,0:04:38.88,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, you're too slow!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:44.88,0:04:47.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's nice that you made a friend, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.09,0:04:47.76,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep!
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.51,0:04:52.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-san said he doesn't have a father.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:53.98,0:04:56.35,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He said his father went somewhere after the divorce.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:56.35,0:04:59.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... You know what divorce is?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:00.23,0:05:03.11,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. When marriage is finished, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:03.11,0:05:06.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, more or less...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:06.07,0:05:10.03,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If God finds out, He punishes the people, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:10.74,0:05:12.33,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.58,0:05:18.17,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my mom is gone because of divorce, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.59,0:05:23.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to meet her?
Dialogue: 4,0:05:25.13,0:05:26.47,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.80,0:05:30.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.39,0:05:36.39,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But you know...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:37.19,0:05:40.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If she's like Kouki-kun's mother, I think I want to meet her!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.02,0:05:42.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:46.90,0:05:48.20,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:48.20,0:05:50.16,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's mother is...?!
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.16,0:05:56.08,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Grandpa's maid is probably Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:56.08,0:05:57.00,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,I don't believe it...
Dialogue: 4,0:05:57.62,0:06:00.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you heard anything about the maid?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.54,0:06:03.25,Main Dialog,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,This was pretty cool.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.25,0:06:04.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A farewell party? For me?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:04.84,0:06:06.63,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry it's taken so long.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.63,0:06:08.97,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Winter clothing orders have finally settled down, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.14,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But I just can't go out at night.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.39,0:06:13.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My girl's six, see...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:13.97,0:06:17.73,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Are you telling me you haven't gone out drinking once since...?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:17.73,0:06:20.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. I just can't get out.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:20.31,0:06:24.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I don't even care about drinking and that stuff anymore.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:24.44,0:06:25.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's my age...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.74,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,But you're only 30...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.41,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, the people in my shipping department are young,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.82,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but a lot of them have kids.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.82,0:06:32.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So it isn't customary to go out drinking...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:32.66,0:06:33.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.49,Main Dialog,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,You got that right.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.49,0:06:37.33,Main Dialog,Kurohige,0000,0000,0000,,I gotta pick up the kid at nursery school, anyway.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.33,0:06:40.21,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,We had two kids in two years and the younger is 3 months old,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:40.21,0:06:42.00,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,so if I don't get home quick, my wife...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.00,0:06:44.50,Main Dialog,Curly Hair,0000,0000,0000,,Turns into "Wifezilla," right?
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.50,0:06:46.71,Main Dialog,Beanpole,0000,0000,0000,,When she gets mad, she's one scary monster...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.26,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:52.80,0:06:53.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.93,0:06:56.60,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I heard about the farewell party!
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.60,0:06:59.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I can't go out at night, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.44,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But they went to the trouble of arranging it,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:01.44,0:07:02.86,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,so how about bringing the kid along?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.77,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring mine, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:04.77,0:07:07.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this your way of saying that you want to go out drinking once in a while?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:07.44,0:07:09.61,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it'll be fine! Right?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:09.61,0:07:11.36,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.03,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Coming, coming...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.58,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, the phone.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:17.95,0:07:19.16,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:19.16,0:07:19.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:20.29,0:07:26.30,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi? It seems Grandpa had a regular maid, sent from an agency...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:26.30,0:07:28.01,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, whoa, wait a second...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.01,0:07:29.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,So, do you know her name?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:29.63,0:07:32.64,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshii Masako-san, spelled with the kanji for "correct" and "child".
Dialogue: 4,0:07:34.01,0:07:37.31,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,That's the name that's on the Maternal and Child Health Handbook, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.31,0:07:38.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I believe so...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:38.22,0:07:40.93,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Do you intend to contact her?!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:41.31,0:07:43.85,Main Dialog,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,She abandoned that precious child...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down a little!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:45.52,0:07:47.48,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You saw the Maternal and Child Health Handbook, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:07:47.48,0:07:49.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's a lot written in there...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:49.57,0:07:52.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's still so much we don't know, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:56.16,0:07:57.74,Main Dialog,Woman,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.74,0:07:59.20,Main Dialog,Drunk,0000,0000,0000,,What I'm saying is...
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.20,0:08:03.46,Main Dialog,Drunk,0000,0000,0000,,I no longer know the difference between work and home...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.08,0:08:03.12,Alt,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Pardon me for being late...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:03.46,0:08:06.29,Main Dialog,Drunk,0000,0000,0000,,You're late! Here, have a seat!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:06.29,0:08:07.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Get away from me, you drunk!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:07.50,0:08:11.34,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?! You came?!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:11.34,0:08:12.93,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.93,0:08:15.22,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,You're adorable!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.35,0:08:21.98,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Eat all you want!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.98,0:08:23.60,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.60,0:08:25.85,Main Dialog,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you're here, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:25.85,0:08:26.98,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.31,0:08:29.19,Main Dialog,Female Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Here you are, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.19,0:08:31.03,Main Dialog,Female Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Is orange juice okay?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.03,0:08:31.78,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mm-hm!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:32.53,0:08:34.36,Main Dialog,Good-looking Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is a beauty, isn't she?
Dialogue: 4,0:08:34.36,0:08:35.74,Main Dialog,Female Employee,0000,0000,0000,,Yep, she sure is a beauty!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.74,0:08:36.87,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,She's embarrassed!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:41.91,0:08:44.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun, I'll gather it together for you.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.04,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, thank you!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:48.59,0:08:51.71,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, please, drink some more!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:52.13,0:08:54.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin might sleep on the way home, so...
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'm going to the washroom.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.14,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Say "bathroom"!
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah, I'm going to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.35,0:09:06.52,Main Dialog,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,He left our section high and dry.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:06.52,0:09:09.90,Main Dialog,Male Employee B,0000,0000,0000,,A person shouldn't produce results, then bail!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:09.90,0:09:11.69,Main Dialog,Male Employee B,0000,0000,0000,,Quitting like that is dishonest!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:11.69,0:09:13.90,Main Dialog,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,Sales haven't come easy this month...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.90,0:09:14.90,Main Dialog,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we do a decent job selling,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.90,0:09:17.45,Main Dialog,Male Employee A,0000,0000,0000,,management won't look at anything but last year's results!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:17.45,0:09:18.87,Main Dialog,Male Employee B,0000,0000,0000,,What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 4,0:09:19.70,0:09:21.20,Main Dialog,Male Employee,0000,0000,0000,,How unfortunate...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.20,0:09:25.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The old me would've stormed in and read them the riot act, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.62,0:09:27.62,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm about to spring a leak...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:28.42,0:09:30.75,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are so soft!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:30.75,0:09:33.71,Main Dialog,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I wanna make {\i1}you{\i0} my kid!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:35.17,0:09:38.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,My sense of importance has changed.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.09,0:09:40.14,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:40.64,0:09:43.10,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,About your transfer...
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.14,0:09:48.81,Main Dialog,Kawamura,0000,0000,0000,,After seeing Rin-chan, I've come around.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.40,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, right?!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.40,0:09:54.53,Main Dialog,Yuu,0000,0000,0000,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.65,0:09:55.28,Alt,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold her forever!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.53,0:09:56.82,Main Dialog,Yuu,0000,0000,0000,,Pick me up, too!
Dialogue: 4,0:09:55.61,0:09:58.20,Alt,Hidaka,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, Rin-chan doesn't wanna be held!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:00.20,0:10:01.24,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.87,0:10:06.04,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What did you think about your child... about Rin?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.00,0:10:09.83,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun was really cute, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You sure do love little kids, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:12.46,0:10:14.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yep! The mail came.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:14.76,0:10:15.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.43,0:10:21.22,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Says this is an elementary school admission information session.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:21.22,0:10:23.72,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I didn't even do anything and this came...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.64,0:10:25.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.31,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There's an admissions test, isn't there?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.31,0:10:31.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, no!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:31.77,0:10:34.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You can get in without taking any test!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.32,0:10:35.11,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:10:35.11,0:10:36.44,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,For sure, for sure!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.44,0:10:39.15,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Compulsory education is amazing!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.62,0:10:44.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Drunk!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:46.16,0:10:48.04,Main Dialog,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot! How's this?!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:51.54,0:10:53.54,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, he's here!
Dialogue: 4,0:10:53.54,0:10:55.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,P-Pardon me...
Dialogue: 4,0:10:56.88,0:10:59.47,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Tch! Everyone else already left!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.09,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.09,0:11:04.72,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, your mother's here!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:05.81,0:11:08.14,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Kouki...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:08.14,0:11:10.06,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:10.48,0:11:12.65,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's been... a while.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are we gonna make it in time?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:16.53,0:11:18.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll grab a taxi!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.61,0:11:20.11,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:22.99,0:11:25.78,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,The childrens' name tags can be turned around,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.78,0:11:30.00,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,and they {\i1}will{\i0} be on the way home from school, so their names aren't visible.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.00,0:11:33.83,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Additionally, tell your child not to go to a park alone, for example,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.83,0:11:36.88,Main Dialog,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,and even if they see an adult that they know, not to go off with that person.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.59,0:11:38.84,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's tough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.80,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of telling them to trust people,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:40.80,0:11:43.47,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,we have to teach them to be suspicious.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:43.47,0:11:44.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.64,0:11:48.56,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That one sheet we were given...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.56,0:11:49.18,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops...
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.18,0:11:50.31,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll carry them! I've got them!
Dialogue: 4,0:11:51.02,0:11:54.77,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know what vaccinations were given up till now?
Dialogue: 4,0:11:57.44,0:11:59.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:59.65,0:12:02.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seems like I just asked an outlandish question...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.57,0:12:03.61,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:03.61,0:12:06.24,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have Rin-chan's Maternal and Child Health Handbook?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, at home...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.37,0:12:11.12,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's got a vaccination record page.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:11.12,0:12:12.41,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So it's okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:14.12,0:12:15.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.59,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I really don't know anything...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:19.59,0:12:22.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,See, I just met Rin for the first time about three months ago...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.09,0:12:25.39,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Three months?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.39,0:12:26.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.39,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's a surprise.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.39,0:12:33.77,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I get the feeling that Rin-chan implicitly trusts you, Daikichi-san...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.77,0:12:36.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure about that...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:36.31,0:12:40.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,At home, she talks back a lot and she's a nag...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:40.78,0:12:43.15,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's proof that she trusts you.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.99,0:12:47.45,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's obvious you're a family.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.37,0:12:49.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Family...
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.91,0:12:53.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.50,0:12:54.67,Main Dialog,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.67,0:12:58.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.05,0:13:07.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:07.97,0:13:09.47,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I just jumped over your shadow!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:15.94,0:13:17.69,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not tired!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:17.69,0:13:18.52,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's okay.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.94,0:13:22.40,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.40,0:13:24.07,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:24.07,0:13:25.95,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down, I said!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:30.53,0:13:31.37,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:32.12,0:13:33.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's got almost everything on the list.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:35.37,0:13:36.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,School satchel?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:36.50,0:13:37.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,No, I haven't gotten that...
Dialogue: 4,0:13:37.25,0:13:38.63,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, you'd better!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:38.63,0:13:42.00,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,By now, all the designer label and fashionable ones are sold out!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:42.00,0:13:43.88,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A normal one is fine.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.22,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,She's a girl, so that won't do!
Dialogue: 4,0:13:46.76,0:13:48.76,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll look this weekend.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:49.85,0:13:53.18,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, are you really going to raise Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:55.06,0:13:58.15,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,After all, you transferred to another section, right?
Dialogue: 4,0:13:58.15,0:14:00.86,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't really thought that far ahead...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.86,0:14:01.65,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.27,0:14:04.86,Main Dialog,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Now I'll do your hair!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:04.86,0:14:05.61,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:07.82,0:14:09.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You two are close, huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.57,0:14:13.74,Main Dialog,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Mothers and daughters are like friends.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.75,0:14:24.55,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come to think of it, Mom and Kazumi are like buddies, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:24.55,0:14:26.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Who's to say that Masako-san's situation hasn't changed
Dialogue: 4,0:14:26.38,0:14:29.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and now she wants to live with her daughter?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:34.56,0:14:37.23,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at how many shots she's had...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.23,0:14:39.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must have...
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.28,0:14:46.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A will!
Dialogue: 4,0:14:46.90,0:14:48.57,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Boing"?
Dialogue: 4,0:14:48.57,0:14:52.07,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"If Masako found it, she would probably get rid of it.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:52.07,0:14:56.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thus, I've taken this... roundabout method.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:57.29,0:15:01.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,However, I don't really know the proper way to write a secret... riddle?
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.63,0:15:04.67,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And this keyboard thing is making a fool of me,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:04.67,0:15:07.38,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I can't proceed at more than a snail's pace."
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.68,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even so, these kanji conversion mistakes are dreadful!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.18,0:15:14.10,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"Already, this feeble-minded old fool's energy is exhausted.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.10,0:15:15.89,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Therefore, I'm giving up on this blog..."
Dialogue: 4,0:15:15.89,0:15:17.47,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's giving up too soon!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:17.47,0:15:18.73,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to the "greatest generation"?!
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.10,0:15:21.60,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,"To be continued in Rin's mother-child health record book..."
Dialogue: 4,0:15:27.23,0:15:28.53,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:28.53,0:15:29.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Let me have a look-see here...
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.95,0:15:36.66,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Based on my prediction
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.66,0:15:42.25,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,that the person who found this piece of paper thinks warmly of Rin,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.25,0:15:46.09,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,I shall give an account here of Rin and her mother, Masako.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:53.22,0:15:56.85,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako is easily misunderstood,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.85,0:16:00.60,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,so I would like to start by saying that she is by no means a bad girl.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:01.02,0:16:04.86,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,She says that she's a failure as a mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.57,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,That she feels sorry for Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:07.19,0:16:13.20,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Even now, she persists in being my maid.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:13.20,0:16:15.87,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,And I believe that she will continue to do so.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:15.87,0:16:19.83,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think of that as Rin's greatest happiness.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:19.83,0:16:22.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Happy? What's he mean?
Dialogue: 4,0:16:23.25,0:16:29.84,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,She is living a vigilant life, carefully leaving no traces of herself behind,
Dialogue: 4,0:16:29.84,0:16:34.47,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,so that if something happens to me, her existence will be hidden from all of my relatives.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:34.47,0:16:38.18,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako certainly has a mother's love for Rin.
Dialogue: 4,0:16:38.64,0:16:46.23,Main Dialog,Souichi,0000,0000,0000,,But she's still young and may not yet have the maturity to be a parent...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:48.48,0:16:50.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really understand it...
Dialogue: 4,0:16:50.86,0:16:57.28,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But the one thing that's clear is that he cared about Rin and her mother.
Dialogue: 4,0:17:08.59,0:17:09.79,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:11.38,0:17:12.84,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:12.84,0:17:13.92,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:13.92,0:17:18.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to make my hair look like rabbit ears!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:18.18,0:17:18.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:19.47,0:17:22.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like Reina-chan's mom did before!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:22.93,0:17:23.85,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I can't!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:23.85,0:17:24.94,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:24.94,0:17:26.81,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way I can do it! It's impossible!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:29.23,0:17:31.15,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it, I said!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:31.61,0:17:32.65,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Because...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:33.49,0:17:35.82,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,she said I wasn't cute!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:35.82,0:17:36.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:37.66,0:17:38.95,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Someone told you that?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:39.78,0:17:43.62,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mii-chan said I wasn't cute at all!
Dialogue: 4,0:17:44.08,0:17:44.70,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 4,0:17:46.46,0:17:48.92,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think Rin wins hands down...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:49.71,0:17:52.30,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be cute, too...
Dialogue: 4,0:17:54.05,0:17:55.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, all right...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:00.80,0:18:02.93,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's already grown to be a fine girl
Dialogue: 4,0:18:02.93,0:18:05.35,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,and that means her feelings can definitely be hurt...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:05.35,0:18:07.64,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san, did you know?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:08.31,0:18:11.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's mind has already developed a lot.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:12.52,0:18:14.90,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's mature in some ways, but not in others.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:15.36,0:18:18.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's why an adult has to keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 4,0:18:22.83,0:18:24.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Fin...ished!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:27.75,0:18:28.54,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:36.21,0:18:40.18,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Twinkle, twinkle, little star...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.18,0:18:41.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey, Rin...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.97,Alt,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,How I wonder what you...
Dialogue: 4,0:18:41.64,0:18:42.97,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:43.72,0:18:46.43,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's a secret, so I can't tell anyone at home about Parents' Day!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:46.43,0:18:48.39,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hah? Parents' Day?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:48.89,0:18:50.31,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,So you can't look!
Dialogue: 4,0:18:51.48,0:18:54.69,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,S-She's gonna do it with that hairstyle?
Dialogue: 4,0:18:56.57,0:19:00.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Twinkle, twinkle, little star,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:01.11,0:19:05.66,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}How I wonder what you are.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.66,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If you left Rin alone,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:05.66,0:19:10.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,thinking she'd eventually forget even something as painful as that...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:06.54,0:19:10.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Up above the world so high,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:11.00,0:19:14.88,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Like a diamond in the sky.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:11.58,0:19:13.96,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I have no misgivings about hating you.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.88,0:19:18.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I want you to at least have had a good reason,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:14.88,0:19:19.05,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Twinkle, twinkle, little star,
Dialogue: 4,0:19:19.26,0:19:23.68,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}How I wonder what you are.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.63,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:23.68,0:19:27.31,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,what could be a good reason for abandoning a child?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.27,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This is cute!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:31.27,0:19:32.94,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's cute, but...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:32.94,0:19:36.61,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Still, you're going to be using it for a long time, so we want something more...
Dialogue: 4,0:19:37.03,0:19:38.32,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:38.32,0:19:40.45,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,A desk for a young lady would be better, don't you think?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:40.99,0:19:42.32,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Young lady?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:44.28,0:19:47.04,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah! One that's for a young lady would be good!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:48.08,0:19:48.87,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 4,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You're sitting there again?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:51.87,0:19:53.50,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I look like a young lady?
Dialogue: 4,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.46,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. And I think you could still use the desk
Dialogue: 4,0:19:55.46,0:19:58.13,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,even when you're a high school student.
Dialogue: 4,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.71,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is a high school student an adult?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess half an adult...
Dialogue: 4,0:20:07.43,0:20:08.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Listen to me read!
Dialogue: 4,0:20:10.56,0:20:14.73,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,"A girl went alone into a forest to play.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:15.31,0:20:21.19,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She lost her way and looked for the path to get back home,
Dialogue: 4,0:20:21.19,0:20:23.61,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,but she just couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 4,0:20:24.36,0:20:29.70,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Suddenly, before she knew it, she came upon a tiny house in the forest."
Dialogue: 4,0:20:44.59,0:20:46.30,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Yoshii-san?
Dialogue: 4,0:20:47.72,0:20:49.06,Main Dialog,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:21.98,0:22:23.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is cute, isn't it?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.65,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?! Rin!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:26.49,0:22:27.36,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:28.15,0:22:29.11,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:30.99,0:22:32.12,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:32.83,0:22:35.25,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you not to run off on your own like that!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:35.25,0:22:36.54,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 4,0:22:37.58,0:22:38.50,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.42,0:22:41.25,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It can make me into a young lady!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:43.75,0:22:44.80,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Forget it!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:44.80,0:22:46.26,Main Dialog,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This is for much later!
Dialogue: 4,0:22:47.92,0:22:48.93,Main Dialog,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
